{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.OrientedSkein.Model.GLnClosure","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.Model.GLnClosure","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.OrientedSkein.Model.GLnDatum"],"declarations":14,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.closeLeftTrace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.closeLeftTrace","kind":"def","line":187,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnClosure.lean#L187-L203","doc":"**The datum's own closure is a left trace** for the crossing, with loop value `qi^n [n]_q`\nand curl `1`; its Markov parameter is again `q^n / [n]_q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.closeD_datum_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.closeD_datum_eq","kind":"theorem","line":167,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnClosure.lean#L167-L185","doc":"**Trace compatibility.**  The skein closure of the `GL_n` datum (cup `η`, leftward cap\n`T ≫ ε`) is `qi^n` times the weighted quantum partial trace of `GLnTrace`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.capL_capT","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.capL_capT","kind":"theorem","line":142,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnClosure.lean#L142-L163","doc":"The leftward cap on the left of `Y` is `∑_a colsum_a · (x₁ ⊗ (x₂ ⊗ y) ↦ x₁_a x₂_a y)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.capT_whiskerRight_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.capT_whiskerRight_apply","kind":"theorem","line":139,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnClosure.lean#L139-L140","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.capT_ee","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.capT_ee","kind":"theorem","line":126,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnClosure.lean#L126-L137","doc":"The leftward cap `T ≫ ε` on basis vectors. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.colsum_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.colsum_eq","kind":"theorem","line":113,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnClosure.lean#L113-L124","doc":"**The column sums of `A⁻¹` are the quantum weights**, rescaled: `∑_c (A⁻¹)_{c a} = qi^n w_a`.\nThis is the curl identity `∑_d w_d A_{d a} = q^n` read as `w^T A = q^n 1^T`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.colsum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.colsum","kind":"def","line":110,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnClosure.lean#L110-L111","doc":"The column sums of `A⁻¹`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.cupL_coev","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.cupL_coev","kind":"theorem","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnClosure.lean#L97-L108","doc":"The cup on the left of `Y` is `∑_c (y ↦ e_c ⊗ (e_c ⊗ y))`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.coev_whiskerRight_apply'","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.coev_whiskerRight_apply'","kind":"theorem","line":92,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnClosure.lean#L92-L94","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.ins_rem_ne","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.ins_rem_ne","kind":"theorem","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnClosure.lean#L88-L90","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.closeD_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.closeD_apply","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnClosure.lean#L76-L78","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.closeD","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.closeD","kind":"def","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnClosure.lean#L66-L74","doc":"**The skein closure of the leftmost strand** for an oriented skein datum: cup `η`, then `f` on\nthe right of `F`, then the leftward cap `T ≫ ε`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.capL","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.capL","kind":"def","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnClosure.lean#L62-L64","doc":"A cap on the left of `Y`: `F ⊗ (E ⊗ Y) ⟶ Y`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.cupL","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.cupL","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/